author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 12:07:11 -0600
subject: fix(observability): forward errorCategory through request-detail pipeline

CAUGHT BY E2E BROWSER TEST: the categorizer was called at the chatCore
error paths but errorCategory was dropped before storage — buildRequestDetail
never included it in its output object, and the repo flush record omitted it.
The detail drawer + markdown report therefore never saw categories.

- requestDetail.js: buildRequestDetail forwards base.errorCategory
- requestDetailsRepo.js: flush record persists item.errorCategory

Tests: tests/unit/error-category-detail.test.js — 3 integration tests
verifying buildRequestDetail forwarding, backward-compat absence, and the
full saveRequestDetail -> getRequestDetails round trip (the exact path that
was broken). All pass alongside the existing categorizer unit tests.

Part of: Observability & Conversation Analytics plan (Phase P3 fix)


